(3166381, 443543, 53316, '<td valign="top">Didn''t think it fit at first but went back to the link in the challenge description - said the first day could be symbolic of Jesus, so I think this photo definitely meets the challenge.  And that makes me happy too as I think the shot is just lovely.</td>', 'Didn''t think it fit at first but went back to the link in the challenge description - said the first day could be symbolic of Jesus, so I think this photo definitely meets the challenge.  And that makes me happy too as I think the shot is just lovely.', '2007-01-01 03:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
