(3166383, 445199, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh ew! But a great take on the challenge - very creative.  Well photographed also, which is good because with the subject being unappealing, it wouldn''t do to have it presented in an unappealing fashion.</td>', 'Oh ew! But a great take on the challenge - very creative.  Well photographed also, which is good because with the subject being unappealing, it wouldn''t do to have it presented in an unappealing fashion.', '2007-01-01 03:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3166385, 444910, 53316, '<td valign="top">A bit of a looser crop at top would have helped in my opinion. But lovely image.  Oh, and the song is The 12 Days of Christmas!! What an awesome little detail.</td>', 'A bit of a looser crop at top would have helped in my opinion. But lovely image.  Oh, and the song is The 12 Days of Christmas!! What an awesome little detail.', '2007-01-01 03:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3166387, 445144, 53316, '<td valign="top">AWESOME. My favorite so far of the rings shots.  It actually has a meaning and it looks like the rings were more meant to go together than the other shots I have seen.</td>', 'AWESOME. My favorite so far of the rings shots.  It actually has a meaning and it looks like the rings were more meant to go together than the other shots I have seen.', '2007-01-01 03:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3166389, 444309, 53316, '<td valign="top">Okay wow. The fact that you got eleven flutes in an obviously candid shot impresses me so much that this is my first 10.  The photo might not have the "wow" appeal but I think that this is awesome in a different way which is just as cool.  I also think the colors and contrast are done nicely.  Great job.</td>', 'Okay wow. The fact that you got eleven flutes in an obviously candid shot impresses me so much that this is my first 10.  The photo might not have the "wow" appeal but I think that this is awesome in a different way which is just as cool.  I also think the colors and contrast are done nicely.  Great job.', '2007-01-01 03:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3166390, 444271, 53316, '<td valign="top">I had the same concept at first, but I''m very glad I went with something else because whatever my shot would have turned out to be, it would not even come CLOSE to the beauty of this image.</td>', 'I had the same concept at first, but I''m very glad I went with something else because whatever my shot would have turned out to be, it would not even come CLOSE to the beauty of this image.', '2007-01-01 03:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
