(3166610, 445067, 29486, '<td valign="top">Finally one that meets the challenge AND looks good. Mine met the challenge which is more than I can say for most but it wasn''t "wow" great. Great capture and post work.</td>', 'Finally one that meets the challenge AND looks good. Mine met the challenge which is more than I can say for most but it wasn''t "wow" great. Great capture and post work.', '2007-01-01 05:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
