(3166646, 444245, 29486, '<td valign="top">It''s 9 ladies dancing and 12 drummers. So what''s your point? Can''t give you much credit on this one.</td>', 'It''s 9 ladies dancing and 12 drummers. So what''s your point? Can''t give you much credit on this one.', '2007-01-01 05:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
