(3169217, 445337, 67258, '<td valign="top">A nice arrangement, and a novel perspective which works very well for the challenge.  It is a shame about the slight over-exposure on the swans feathers, but white birds are notoriously hard to get right.  Other than the exposure, the only ting I would change would be to include all of the swan at the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'A nice arrangement, and a novel perspective which works very well for the challenge.  It is a shame about the slight over-exposure on the swans feathers, but white birds are notoriously hard to get right.  Other than the exposure, the only ting I would change would be to include all of the swan at the bottom of the frame.', '2007-01-02 04:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169221, 445194, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely in b&amp;w - it <i>may</i> have been better to include the whole of the reflection, although I do like this composition.</td>', 'Lovely in b&w - it may have been better to include the whole of the reflection, although I do like this composition.', '2007-01-02 04:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169224, 445067, 67258, '<td valign="top">A tad over-exposed.  Have you boosted the colour saturation?  The swans bills look a little unnatural.<br/>Nonetheless, well done for getting a shot with seven swans in!</td>', 'A tad over-exposed.  Have you boosted the colour saturation?  The swans bills look a little unnatural.Nonetheless, well done for getting a shot with seven swans in!', '2007-01-02 04:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169236, 445367, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the idea - the dirty hands indicating to me hard work to pay for gold, r that gold is of the earth, the heart-shape of the hands indicating love, the presentation of the rings as a gift.</td>', 'I like the idea - the dirty hands indicating to me hard work to pay for gold, r that gold is of the earth, the heart-shape of the hands indicating love, the presentation of the rings as a gift.', '2007-01-02 04:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169253, 444242, 67258, '<td valign="top">I don''t have a problem with fewer swans being depicted than the song indicates, although I have given an extra mark to those that either did find them, or had the patience to wait.  That said, I am not scoring this high for a number of reasons:<br/>The swans are a little over-exposed - if you are using a camera where you can choose the metering, use partial or spot, focussing in on the feathers; alternatively go with the cameras suggestion and then dial down 2/3 of a stop.<br/>The composition lacks dynamism - the swans are swimming away from the viewer - there is no interaction.<br/>The object dissected by the swan''s neck (a moorhen, or a rock perhaps) jostles for the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'I don''t have a problem with fewer swans being depicted than the song indicates, although I have given an extra mark to those that either did find them, or had the patience to wait.  That said, I am not scoring this high for a number of reasons:The swans are a little over-exposed - if you are using a camera where you can choose the metering, use partial or spot, focussing in on the feathers; alternatively go with the cameras suggestion and then dial down 2/3 of a stop.The composition lacks dynamism - the swans are swimming away from the viewer - there is no interaction.The object dissected by the swan''s neck (a moorhen, or a rock perhaps) jostles for the viewer''s attention.', '2007-01-02 04:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169255, 444995, 67258, '<td valign="top">Look more like pigeons , but quite close enough for me!  Excellent choice of depth of field, an I love the grey colour pallette.</td>', 'Look more like pigeons , but quite close enough for me!  Excellent choice of depth of field, an I love the grey colour pallette.', '2007-01-02 04:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169259, 443402, 67258, '<td valign="top">A bit dull and flat, but well done for finding the requisite number of geese!  I like the rear goose looking back over its shoulder.</td>', 'A bit dull and flat, but well done for finding the requisite number of geese!  I like the rear goose looking back over its shoulder.', '2007-01-02 04:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169261, 443072, 67258, '<td valign="top">Not particlarly keen on the post-processing here - low light HDR?</td>', 'Not particlarly keen on the post-processing here - low light HDR?', '2007-01-02 04:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169265, 444647, 44878, '<td valign="top">I really like the sharpness of this Photo, and the Humour that Goes with it<br/>although I am not sure some of the more sterio Types will get your angle.<br/>Good luck and I Hope the Bird Made it past Christmas !</td>', 'I really like the sharpness of this Photo, and the Humour that Goes with italthough I am not sure some of the more sterio Types will get your angle.Good luck and I Hope the Bird Made it past Christmas !', '2007-01-02 04:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169268, 445067, 44878, '<td valign="top">I think you went over the Top a Wee Bit on the Saturation.<br/>Good Luck Though</td>', 'I think you went over the Top a Wee Bit on the Saturation.Good Luck Though', '2007-01-02 04:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3169270, 445199, 44878, '<td valign="top">Good Idea, I thinh I would have changed what is around your Pear to make it more dramatic.<br/>Well done and good luck</td>', 'Good Idea, I thinh I would have changed what is around your Pear to make it more dramatic.Well done and good luck', '2007-01-02 04:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
