(3169363, 444200, 45631, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of when we would visit the Farm and the kids would all fight to collect the eggs. - 8</td>', 'Reminds me of when we would visit the Farm and the kids would all fight to collect the eggs. - 8', '2007-01-02 05:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
