(3181005, 443262, 53572, '<td valign="top">a nice idea, and a good take on a cliche subject matter.  the image is well focused and exposed.  however, a tighter crop, and a straitened image would probably help.  you need to make us see the ring pulls, all we see are 5 beer cans on a carpet.  cropping right in to the tops of the tins would hav made the image much more dramatic and interesting.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=447228" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/447228.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/447228.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/447228.jpg"/></a></td>', 'a nice idea, and a good take on a cliche subject matter.  the image is well focused and exposed.  however, a tighter crop, and a straitened image would probably help.  you need to make us see the ring pulls, all we see are 5 beer cans on a carpet.  cropping right in to the tops of the tins would hav made the image much more dramatic and interesting. ', '2007-01-04 13:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
