(3181934, 445312, 52500, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to explain myself...I gave you a 3.  I don''t have a problem with the symbolism, just the picture.  I find the subject uninteresting as presented, and the lighting and colors are very harsh.  I think it was a good idea, but got lost in the execution.</td>', 'Just wanted to explain myself...I gave you a 3.  I don''t have a problem with the symbolism, just the picture.  I find the subject uninteresting as presented, and the lighting and colors are very harsh.  I think it was a good idea, but got lost in the execution.', '2007-01-04 17:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3181940, 444777, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.  I love it.  Of course, I''m a drummer, so maybe I''m biased a bit! <i>Great job.  Back to bump to a 9.</i></td>', 'Great perspective.  I love it.  Of course, I''m a drummer, so maybe I''m biased a bit! Great job.  Back to bump to a 9.', '2007-01-04 17:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
