(3183011, 444465, 40355, '<td valign="top">Love the abstract look.  Very well composed, nice use of the Rule of Thirds.  And it''s got a bit of fun to it, which is always nice!  9</td>', 'Love the abstract look.  Very well composed, nice use of the Rule of Thirds.  And it''s got a bit of fun to it, which is always nice!  9', '2007-01-04 22:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183016, 444966, 40355, '<td valign="top">I can only imagine what it took to get this shot.  It''s a wonderful capture.  Great composition, exposure dead on, and it meets the challenge dead-on.  On top of which, it''s very enjoyable.  10</td>', 'I can only imagine what it took to get this shot.  It''s a wonderful capture.  Great composition, exposure dead on, and it meets the challenge dead-on.  On top of which, it''s very enjoyable.  10', '2007-01-04 22:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183020, 445367, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very emotive shot.  The contrast between the rings and the hands has a lot of feeling and meaning to it, and it really comes across.  On top of which, the technicals are very good as well.</td>', 'Very emotive shot.  The contrast between the rings and the hands has a lot of feeling and meaning to it, and it really comes across.  On top of which, the technicals are very good as well.', '2007-01-04 22:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183026, 445194, 40355, '<td valign="top">The best of the swan captures in this challenge, IMO.  There''s only one of him, but he is artfully shown, with great detail and excellent technical skill.  Well done!</td>', 'The best of the swan captures in this challenge, IMO.  There''s only one of him, but he is artfully shown, with great detail and excellent technical skill.  Well done!', '2007-01-04 22:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183033, 444009, 40355, '<td valign="top">Unique (and beautiful) piece of jewelry, it really lends itself to the challenge.  Solid capture, although the background might look a bit better were it blown to solid white.  I''m not crazy about the border either, but that''s just a personal thing.</td>', 'Unique (and beautiful) piece of jewelry, it really lends itself to the challenge.  Solid capture, although the background might look a bit better were it blown to solid white.  I''m not crazy about the border either, but that''s just a personal thing.', '2007-01-04 22:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183037, 444885, 40355, '<td valign="top">A great shot, and interesting to study.  More photojournalistic or environmental portrait in style, but it meets the challenge very well, with an unique vision.  You put the motion blur to great use, very artfully done.</td>', 'A great shot, and interesting to study.  More photojournalistic or environmental portrait in style, but it meets the challenge very well, with an unique vision.  You put the motion blur to great use, very artfully done.', '2007-01-04 22:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183042, 445263, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very etherial feel to this, nice use of shallow DOF.  I like the glint coming off them, but I''m not so crazy about the banding in the band.  Maybe processing?  Or just the small upload size.  Either way, I won''t hold it against you. :-)</td>', 'Very etherial feel to this, nice use of shallow DOF.  I like the glint coming off them, but I''m not so crazy about the banding in the band.  Maybe processing?  Or just the small upload size.  Either way, I won''t hold it against you. :-)', '2007-01-04 22:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183043, 444647, 40355, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait of him, tack sharp and very colorful.  Perhaps a bit of a stretch to the challenge, but a very nice piece of photography.</td>', 'Very nice portrait of him, tack sharp and very colorful.  Perhaps a bit of a stretch to the challenge, but a very nice piece of photography.', '2007-01-04 22:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183056, 444415, 40355, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure I liked this at first, but the more I studied it, the more I did.  Partly it''s the color contrasts, the red lips, the hat, and the way the gold just jumps out at you.  And partly it''s the pose and the use of a model to show the rings, and the fact that they are a varied selection of rings.  Well done.</td>', 'I wasn''t sure I liked this at first, but the more I studied it, the more I did.  Partly it''s the color contrasts, the red lips, the hat, and the way the gold just jumps out at you.  And partly it''s the pose and the use of a model to show the rings, and the fact that they are a varied selection of rings.  Well done.', '2007-01-04 22:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183060, 444681, 40355, '<td valign="top">Unusual take on the drummers, but it really works.  Simple, but elegant.</td>', 'Unusual take on the drummers, but it really works.  Simple, but elegant.', '2007-01-04 22:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3183435, 445214, 45672, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Very creative idea.  Nice job with the vignetting.  It really brings the viewer in.  +8</td>', 'Awesome!  Very creative idea.  Nice job with the vignetting.  It really brings the viewer in.  +8', '2007-01-04 23:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
