(3196029, 444647, 66384, '<td valign="top">This got a 9 from me. I love it. I think the only reason I didn''t go to 10 was that it was really stretching the challenge envelope. Terrific shot in all ways. Congratulations on your score, and for finishing in the top 10!</td>', 'This got a 9 from me. I love it. I think the only reason I didn''t go to 10 was that it was really stretching the challenge envelope. Terrific shot in all ways. Congratulations on your score, and for finishing in the top 10!', '2007-01-08 12:56:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3196055, 444395, 66384, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7, partly for the creativity of it. I would have liked it better if the bird was in a more natural position, looking like it really belonged in the tree. And for the composition, I think I would have liked the bird lower and more to the left -- with the beak leading my eye up into the tree, rather than with the tail leading my eye down and out of the picture.</td>', 'I gave this a 7, partly for the creativity of it. I would have liked it better if the bird was in a more natural position, looking like it really belonged in the tree. And for the composition, I think I would have liked the bird lower and more to the left -- with the beak leading my eye up into the tree, rather than with the tail leading my eye down and out of the picture.', '2007-01-08 13:05:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3196084, 445312, 66384, '<td valign="top">Whoa, a brown ribbon with a shot of the Bible. This deserves an OOBIE for sure.<br/> <br/>I am a little bothered by not being able to read the word ''New'' easily. I''d be curious to see what would happen if you used Gradient Map on this image to achieve the colors.</td>', 'Whoa, a brown ribbon with a shot of the Bible. This deserves an OOBIE for sure. I am a little bothered by not being able to read the word ''New'' easily. I''d be curious to see what would happen if you used Gradient Map on this image to achieve the colors.', '2007-01-08 13:17:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3196310, 444094, 23484, '<td valign="top">Julianne, I thought this was nicely done.  I gave you a 6 on this only because I thought the white box cover was a little distracting. Otherwise, it would have been a 7.</td>', 'Julianne, I thought this was nicely done.  I gave you a 6 on this only because I thought the white box cover was a little distracting. Otherwise, it would have been a 7.', '2007-01-08 14:25:23.000000', NULL, 0),
