(3197490, 445367, 66348, '<td valign="top">Hey bud, I bet your glad that you had some left over dirt eh? Awesome idea and shot. Love the dirt with the rings, it really brings out the detail of the hands so much more with the dirt. Nice work.</td>', 'Hey bud, I bet your glad that you had some left over dirt eh? Awesome idea and shot. Love the dirt with the rings, it really brings out the detail of the hands so much more with the dirt. Nice work.', '2007-01-08 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
