(3234522, 445191, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by levyj413:</b></div><hr/><i> Funny.  I didn''t know how you got the effect, so I submitted it for validation.  But I loved it, and voted it an 8.<br/> <br/>Thanks for mentioning the multifaceted lens.  Us non-DLSR folks just don''t know what kinds of wild and crazy lenses are out there. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Here''s the set-up for this shot.<br/> <br/>Note that this is a 50-cent kid''s multi-faceted lens (often sold as a "kaleidoscope") hand-held in front of the lens of my Olympus D490 P&amp;S camera, not a specialty lens, and my Olympus is about as non-dSLR as it gets these days!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=453530" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/453530.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/453530.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/453530.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by levyj413: Funny.  I didn''t know how you got the effect, so I submitted it for validation.  But I loved it, and voted it an 8. Thanks for mentioning the multifaceted lens.  Us non-DLSR folks just don''t know what kinds of wild and crazy lenses are out there.  Here''s the set-up for this shot. Note that this is a 50-cent kid''s multi-faceted lens (often sold as a "kaleidoscope") hand-held in front of the lens of my Olympus D490 P&S camera, not a specialty lens, and my Olympus is about as non-dSLR as it gets these days! ', '2007-01-15 11:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
